@startuml forms-vol03-flow
title Sample flow - ordering a test and returning the result
autonumber

actor "Ordering\nclinician" as DR
participant "DHP\nFHIR server" as DHP
participant "LIS / imaging\n(external)" as LIS

DR -> DHP : POST ServiceRequest (the order)
DHP -> LIS : order routed to lab / modality
LIS -> LIS : collect Specimen, run analysis\n(form 029 sampling, 034 lab register)
LIS -> DHP : POST Observation per result row\n+ DiagnosticReport (form 040-130 tahlili,\nor 015-x / 017 / 019 / 020 bayoni)
DHP -> DR : result available, linked back to the order

note over LIS, DHP
  Imaging (015 ultrasound, 017 X-ray, 019 CT/MRI)
  adds an ImagingStudy and, with PACS, a DICOM reference.
end note
@enduml
